    <description>2025-06-23: Now not taking partially paid sums in to calculation when setting rest invoice amounts.
2025-03-31: Now not adding unpaid invoices to restInvoiceAmount when member has feecategory &quot;Dubbelansluten SRAT&quot;
2024-06-27: Now cancel all invoices. A rest invoice will be generated upon re-entrance to Akavia by other logic at middleware
2024-04-19: Temp solution to only cancel invoices for members making cancelling the membership during Yrk1 and before any invoices has been payed. Don&apos;t cancel invoices for already paying members.
Edit: RestInvoiceAmount is not set if Membership Category is Yrk1 and NoOfPayedInvoicesAsEmployed is 0
NOTE: In MasterDev version 5 contains changes that are not present in this version.</description>
